    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d164">

                <pb facs="0144" n="124" xml:id="pg124"/>

                <head>Mr. Dayton to Mr.
                        Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 507.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-07-08"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 8, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>A copy of the despatch of Mr. Mansfield to your department, dated 10th of
                    February last, was transmitted by me, according to instructions to the minister
                    of foreign affairs, as stating more explicitly the character of injury suffered
                    by Mr. Mansfield, and the reparations demanded.</p>
                <p>Herewith I transmit to you a translation of M. Drouyn de l’Huys’s answer to his
                    and your last communication.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WM. L. DAYTON.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, &amp;c., &amp;c.,
                        &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d164-a1.xml" xpointer="d164-a1"/>
